  "description": "Collection of .NET streaming lexer and tokenizers for Markdown, HTML, JSON, XML, C#, TypeScript, Python, SQL, CSS, YAML, TOML, C, C++, Java, Go, Rust, Kotlin and Swift processing, plus a stream-capable Markdown to HTML converter (ToHtml API). See README for usage and details.",
