  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "BREAKING: token emission is now async end-to-end.\n- All ParseAsync/Parse handler overloads take Func<TToken, Task> instead of Action<TToken>; the parse loop awaits the handler for every token.\n- Renamed: RegisterInlineTokenHandler is now InlineMetadata<TToken>.ParseInlinesAsync(handler) - call and await it from inside the container token's handler; it completes when the section is fully consumed (the onInlinesCompleted callback is gone).\n- ToHtml: MarkdownConverter writes asynchronously straight to the caller's TextWriter. ToHtml(string)/ToHtmlDocument(string) are kept as in-memory convenience wrappers (sync-over-async).\nSee the v8 to v9 migration guide: https://crwsolutions.github.io/ntokenizers/migrating-v8-v9",
